      "id": 490302,
      "username": "ssnraju",
      "name": "Dr,. SSN Raju",
      "created_at": "2026-01-06T06:59:50.125Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We are facing a consistent issue in ERPNext v15 regarding Workspace creation.</p>\n<p>Setup:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Two Frappe Cloud sites:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Production</p>\n<p>Learning</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>ERPNext v15 / Frappe v15</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Logged in explicitly as the core system user <strong>Administrator</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Issue:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Workspace list is visible</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>BUT there is <strong>no option to create a new Workspace</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>No “New / Create Workspace / Add Workspace” button</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Not visible in Build → Workspace</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Not visible via /app/workspace</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>This happens on BOTH sites</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Administrator user existence is confirmed:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Production: visible in User list</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Learning: confirmed via Frappe Cloud logs (“Login as Administrator by <a href=\"mailto:erpnext@omsspltd.com\">erpnext@omsspltd.com</a>”)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Question:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Is this a known ERPNext v15 behavior or regression?</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Is Workspace creation restricted further than Administrator/System Manager?</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Is there a config / flag required on Frappe Cloud?</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Any guidance from the core team or others who faced this would be appreciated.</p>",
