      "created_at": "2026-01-06T15:35:33.288Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In version 15, you can now create a new workspace directly from the workspace section of any module. The option to add a workspace from the Workspace doctype has been removed.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/e/5e3dab7f5f50ae8f01799e294b5de7236abe1c93.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5e3dab7f5f50ae8f01799e294b5de7236abe1c93\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/e/5e3dab7f5f50ae8f01799e294b5de7236abe1c93_2_690x327.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"drH0A8gJwpX8Soo4yS8b1q8dg79\" width=\"690\" height=\"327\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/e/5e3dab7f5f50ae8f01799e294b5de7236abe1c93_2_690x327.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/e/5e3dab7f5f50ae8f01799e294b5de7236abe1c93_2_1035x490.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/e/5e3dab7f5f50ae8f01799e294b5de7236abe1c93_2_1380x654.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2880×1368 248 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
